{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110709","id":2845411015,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6pmYbH","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110709","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110709.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110709.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110709","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110709/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110709/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110709/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/8a7a0faa75b573946aac9971c93fca3b6c7b3193","number":110709,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add `reserve()` to `Dictionary`, apply to constructors on GDScript VM","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"`HashMap` has a `reserve()` function, so I thought: why not expose it to `Dictionary` considering `CowData`/`Vector`'s `reserve()` is exposed to `Array`? There is a lot of places within the engine we could use it to reduce bottleneck.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, implementing is quite simple since all needed is to call the `HashMap`'s own `reserve()`, much like how `clear()` in `Dictionary` is mostly a wrapper to its internal `HashMap`'s `clear()`.\r\n\r\nWhile looking for a candidate for a stress test, I noticed in the GDScript VM that the constructor for both untyped and typed `Dictionary` uses a for loop with known final size, so that was possibly the best one. The test I wrote consists in declaring a `Dictionary` with 63 elements mid-function 2²¹ times.\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary><strong>Script</strong></summary>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nextends Node\r\n\r\n\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n\tbenchmark_untyped()\r\n\tbenchmark_typed()\r\n\r\n\r\nfunc benchmark_untyped() -> void:\r\n\tvar time_start := Time.get_ticks_usec()\r\n\tfor i in pow(2, 21):\r\n\t\tvar x := {\r\n\t\t\t1: 1,\r\n\t\t\t2: 2,\r\n\t\t\t3: 4,\r\n\t\t\t4: 8,\r\n\t\t\t5: 16,\r\n\t\t\t6: 32,\r\n\t\t\t7: 64,\r\n\t\t\t8: 128,\r\n\t\t\t9: 256,\r\n\t\t\t10: 512,\r\n\t\t\t11: 1024,\r\n\t\t\t12: 2048,\r\n\t\t\t13: 4096,\r\n\t\t\t14: 8192,\r\n\t\t\t15: 16384,\r\n\t\t\t16: 32768,\r\n\t\t\t17: 65536,\r\n\t\t\t18: 131072,\r\n\t\t\t19: 262144,\r\n\t\t\t20: 524288,\r\n\t\t\t21: 1048576,\r\n\t\t\t22: 2097152,\r\n\t\t\t23: 4194304,\r\n\t\t\t24: 8388608,\r\n\t\t\t25: 16777216,\r\n\t\t\t26: 33554432,\r\n\t\t\t27: 67108864,\r\n\t\t\t28: 134217728,\r\n\t\t\t29: 268435456,\r\n\t\t\t30: 536870912,\r\n\t\t\t31: 1073741824,\r\n\t\t\t32: 2147483648,\r\n\t\t\t33: 4294967296,\r\n\t\t\t34: 8589934592,\r\n\t\t\t35: 17179869184,\r\n\t\t\t36: 34359738368,\r\n\t\t\t37: 68719476736,\r\n\t\t\t38: 137438953472,\r\n\t\t\t39: 274877906944,\r\n\t\t\t40: 549755813888,\r\n\t\t\t41: 1099511627776,\r\n\t\t\t42: 2199023255552,\r\n\t\t\t43: 4398046511104,\r\n\t\t\t44: 8796093022208,\r\n\t\t\t45: 17592186044416,\r\n\t\t\t46: 35184372088832,\r\n\t\t\t47: 70368744177664,\r\n\t\t\t48: 140737488355328,\r\n\t\t\t49: 281474976710656,\r\n\t\t\t50: 562949953421312,\r\n\t\t\t51: 1125899906842624,\r\n\t\t\t52: 2251799813685248,\r\n\t\t\t53: 4503599627370496,\r\n\t\t\t54: 9007199254740992,\r\n\t\t\t55: 18014398509481984,\r\n\t\t\t56: 36028797018963968,\r\n\t\t\t57: 72057594037927936,\r\n\t\t\t58: 144115188075855872,\r\n\t\t\t59: 288230376151711744,\r\n\t\t\t60: 576460752303423488,\r\n\t\t\t61: 1152921504606846976,\r\n\t\t\t62: 2305843009213693952,\r\n\t\t\t63: 4611686018427387904,\r\n\t\t}\r\n\tvar time_end := Time.get_ticks_usec()\r\n\tprint(\"time untyped: %dms\" % ((time_end - time_start) / 1000))\r\n\r\n\r\nfunc benchmark_typed() -> void:\r\n\tvar time_start := Time.get_ticks_usec()\r\n\tfor i in pow(2, 21):\r\n\t\tvar x: Dictionary[int, int] = {\r\n\t\t\t1: 1,\r\n\t\t\t2: 2,\r\n\t\t\t3: 4,\r\n\t\t\t4: 8,\r\n\t\t\t5: 16,\r\n\t\t\t6: 32,\r\n\t\t\t7: 64,\r\n\t\t\t8: 128,\r\n\t\t\t9: 256,\r\n\t\t\t10: 512,\r\n\t\t\t11: 1024,\r\n\t\t\t12: 2048,\r\n\t\t\t13: 4096,\r\n\t\t\t14: 8192,\r\n\t\t\t15: 16384,\r\n\t\t\t16: 32768,\r\n\t\t\t17: 65536,\r\n\t\t\t18: 131072,\r\n\t\t\t19: 262144,\r\n\t\t\t20: 524288,\r\n\t\t\t21: 1048576,\r\n\t\t\t22: 2097152,\r\n\t\t\t23: 4194304,\r\n\t\t\t24: 8388608,\r\n\t\t\t25: 16777216,\r\n\t\t\t26: 33554432,\r\n\t\t\t27: 67108864,\r\n\t\t\t28: 134217728,\r\n\t\t\t29: 268435456,\r\n\t\t\t30: 536870912,\r\n\t\t\t31: 1073741824,\r\n\t\t\t32: 2147483648,\r\n\t\t\t33: 4294967296,\r\n\t\t\t34: 8589934592,\r\n\t\t\t35: 17179869184,\r\n\t\t\t36: 34359738368,\r\n\t\t\t37: 68719476736,\r\n\t\t\t38: 137438953472,\r\n\t\t\t39: 274877906944,\r\n\t\t\t40: 549755813888,\r\n\t\t\t41: 1099511627776,\r\n\t\t\t42: 2199023255552,\r\n\t\t\t43: 4398046511104,\r\n\t\t\t44: 8796093022208,\r\n\t\t\t45: 17592186044416,\r\n\t\t\t46: 35184372088832,\r\n\t\t\t47: 70368744177664,\r\n\t\t\t48: 140737488355328,\r\n\t\t\t49: 281474976710656,\r\n\t\t\t50: 562949953421312,\r\n\t\t\t51: 1125899906842624,\r\n\t\t\t52: 2251799813685248,\r\n\t\t\t53: 4503599627370496,\r\n\t\t\t54: 9007199254740992,\r\n\t\t\t55: 18014398509481984,\r\n\t\t\t56: 36028797018963968,\r\n\t\t\t57: 72057594037927936,\r\n\t\t\t58: 144115188075855872,\r\n\t\t\t59: 288230376151711744,\r\n\t\t\t60: 576460752303423488,\r\n\t\t\t61: 1152921504606846976,\r\n\t\t\t62: 2305843009213693952,\r\n\t\t\t63: 4611686018427387904,\r\n\t\t}\r\n\tvar time_end := Time.get_ticks_usec()\r\n\tprint(\"time typed: %dms\" % ((time_end - time_start) / 1000))\r\n```\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n\r\nI made two template release builds, with and without this PR, and ran the script.\r\n\r\nBefore:\r\n```\r\ntime untyped: 4858ms\r\ntime typed: 5390ms\r\n```\r\n\r\nAfter\r\n```\r\ntime untyped: 4420ms\r\ntime typed: 4810ms\r\n```\r\n\r\nThere are countless places where `reserve()` could be used, so this is just a beginning.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url